meta {
  name: Update Config
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system-config
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "maintenance_mode": false,
    "registration_enabled": true,
    "platform_fee_percent": 5,
    "support_email": "support@gighub.com"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Admin — Update System Config

  Admin only. Updates system configuration values (all fields optional).

  ### Request Body
  | Field                 | Type    | Required | Description                     |
  |-----------------------|---------|----------|---------------------------------|
  | maintenance_mode      | boolean | No       | Enable maintenance mode         |
  | registration_enabled  | boolean | No       | Allow new registrations         |
  | platform_fee_percent  | number  | No       | Platform fee (0–100)            |
  | max_gig_images        | number  | No       | Max images per gig              |
  | max_portfolio_images  | number  | No       | Max portfolio images            |
  | max_upload_size_mb    | number  | No       | Max upload size in MB           |
  | support_email         | string  | No       | Support email address           |
  | support_phone         | string  | No       | Support phone number            |

  ### Headers
  | Header        | Value               | Required |
  |---------------|---------------------|----------|
  | Authorization | Bearer {{authToken}}| ✅       |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "System configuration updated successfully",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **400** — Validation error
  - **401** — Missing/invalid token
  - **403** — Forbidden (not admin)
}
